              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="legend">Compiled {compareAsOf} from each project's own documentation: Snuffleupagus (snuffleupagus.readthedocs.io), OpenRASP (github.com/baidu/openrasp), Aikido Zen (github.com/AikidoSec/firewall-php), ModSecurity &amp; OWASP CRS (owasp.org / owasp-modsecurity), Datadog (docs.datadoghq.com). These tools do more than Howdah in their own areas; Howdah's point is the narrow, in-PHP, EOL-friendly niche. Found something out of date? <a href={`${REPO}/issues`}>Tell us</a>.</p>
